flowchart TD
    Internet((Internet))
    IGW[Internet Gateway]
    VPC[VPC 172.31.0.0/16]
    RT[Main Route Table]
    NACL[Custom Network ACL]
    SUBNET[Public Subnet 172.31.0.0/20]
    EC2[EC2 Instances]

    Internet <--> IGW
    IGW <--> RT
    RT <--> VPC
    VPC --> NACL
    NACL --> SUBNET
    SUBNET --> EC2

    NACL --- IN[Inbound: HTTP 80 / HTTPS 443]
    NACL --- OUT[Outbound: Allow All]